```mermaid
classDiagram
  class AffiliateProgram {
    +uuid id
    +string name
    +string region
    +string status
  }
  class AffiliateOffer {
    +uuid id
    +string slug
    +datetime start_at
    +datetime end_at
    +json tags
  }
  class AffiliateDisclosureProfile {
    +uuid id
    +string locale
    +string short_copy
    +string long_copy
  }
  class AffiliateTaxonomyLink {
    +uuid offer_id
    +string taxonomy_type
    +string taxonomy_id
  }

  AffiliateProgram <|-- AffiliateOffer
  AffiliateOffer --> AffiliateDisclosureProfile : uses
  AffiliateOffer --> AffiliateTaxonomyLink : links
```
